ely ugly red eyes stare to eternity. It is the most human of the demon species which may have made it to be the ultimate race of the demons. This demon is around 20 feet tall. Claws of  this ultimate chaos demon are steel-like and look like those could cut any kind of materials. mmh inspa vähä karkas ni ei tullu nii hyviä ku aioin mutta jos nuoki...**Devil**Subj: WarlockiDate: Nov 13voisin tässä kohta vaikka testaa jos pääsee**Devil**Subj: WarlockDate: Nov 14eise haittaa mitään vaikkei toimiskaa...haluun vaa kerätä masteryt ja dempan isoks sillä :)cmon..otanyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyyt..whineeeeeeeeeeeee**Koff**Subj: Ehkä?Date: Nov 155M = Initiate of the Third Circle |Scavenger Demon|10M = Member of the Third Circle |Punisher Demon|20M = Adept of the third Circle |Executioner Demon|50M = Master of the Third Circle |Spawn Demon|75M = Candidate of the Second Circle |Blood Demon|100M = Member of the Second Circle |Torturer Demon|175M = Elder of the Second Circle |Spike Demon|300M = Ruler of the Second Circle |Horn Demon|500M = Servant of the First Circle |Wicked Demon|750M = Follower of the First Circle |Reaver Demon|900M = Member of the First Circle |Chaos Demon|1G =  Overlord of the Warlocks |Demon Lord|**Koff**Subj: Spawn demon descDate: Nov 16This is a famous and feared spawn demon, summoned from the deepest pits of chaos. Ground trembles andshakes as it walks around or just changes it's standing position. This demon has no wings or tail as demonsusually have. Wings and tail are compensated by it's enormous fists, big enough to smash down houses orjust to crush tiny little beings on it's way. Darkness and chaos surrounds this being, protecting it andgiving strength to it. There is no weak spots in it's body, you can only see muscles all over, coloureddeep red, or maybe it's blood, who knows? There are no rumours heard about these demons, maybe no one hasbefore met this type, or maybe no one has lived to tell those tales.**Devil**Subj: warlockDate: Nov 17päästäs miut testaamaan plz :X**Koff**Subj: Skill namesDate: Nov 17Cast aura of menace = cast chaos shelteringCast chaos blessing = cast aid of chaosCast draw chaos = cast plane of chaosCast chaos demon = cast beast controlCast cure evil = cast warmth of chaosCast chaos weapon = cast anvil of chaosCast boost chaos weapon = cast blessing of chaosCast chaos plane = cast void travelCast chaos armour = cast forge of chaos**Koff**Subj: shidDate: Nov 18Siel on viel ainaki Grand Warlocks killassa yks vanha skilli (cast chaos blessing), sen tilalla pitäis vissiin olla cast forge of chaos koska sitä ei näy saavan mistään muualta ku ekasta guildista ja sieltäkin vaan Weak asteelle. Eipä täs muuta. meenpä nukkumaan. =)Kyl tämä tästä viel suivaantuu, älä huoli. mä oon sun tukenas ;)**Koff**Subj: Blood demonDate: Nov 19This is the Blood Demon, smallest and weakest demon of Second Circle. But infact it's not so weak, itcould single handedly kill all demons of Third Circle. The name 'Blood demon' comes from it's color. And maybe the way it's born affects the name. These demons are born, or actually made from pool of blood. It requires lot of blood, as you can conclude from it's size, it's HUGE! The blood in the poolis from paladins, that's the best way to humiliate the main enemies of warlocks. These demons also need to have fresh blood to keep their form and strength. As it walks it leaves bloody footprintsand drips blood everywhere. Also the victims of these demons are easily identified, because they areall over bloody, but their veins got nothing inside.**Maple**Subj: WarlocksDate: Nov 21I would like to be a tester of warlocks.**"
